/P 449 0 R
/E (With this report, I am not looking for technical rigor or to bore you with data. I have tried to do it in a schematic way, dynamic to read and with as little wordiness as possible. What I am trying to tell here are my conclusions from all these conversations, which do not necessarily have to be correct. Nor am I trying to include everything that is happening in the world of padel, and I trust that it will be useful for everyone who reads it)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
