/P 449 0 R
/E (In short, I have preferred to focus on the current situation of the sector and where it is headed. I highly recommend the final section, with some personal recommendations for brands that set up stands or are considering doing so. I believe it can help those companies for which this represents a significant part of their budget. All this comes about because it makes me quite sad to see marketing budgets and hopes that do not end up giving the expected result. As an example, I talk about the companies that, from my point of view, I believe have stood out the most in these events, both professionally and personally)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
